extends layout

block content
  div.pad2
    if error
      h2 Token request refused
      p= error
    else
      h2 Approve API access
      p
        | A tool running on this computer (
        code= redirectHost
        | ) asks for a
        b  #{request.scope}
        |  token for the CVE records of
        b  #{request.pmc}
        | , acting as
        b  #{username}
        | .
      if request.scope == 'write'
        p It will be able to read and change those records, and nothing else.
      else
        p It will be able to read those records, but not change them.
      p The token lasts as long as this login. Log out to revoke it.
      p Approve only if you started this request yourself, just now.
      form(method='POST', action='/users/token/authorize')
        input(type='hidden', name='_csrf', value=csrfToken)
        input(type='hidden', name='pmc', value=request.pmc)
        input(type='hidden', name='scope', value=request.scope)
        input(type='hidden', name='redirect_uri', value=request.redirectUri)
        input(type='hidden', name='state', value=request.state)
        input(type='hidden', name='code_challenge', value=request.codeChallenge)
        input(type='hidden', name='code_challenge_method', value='S256')
        button.btn.sfe(type='submit', name='decision', value='approve') Approve
        |
        |
        button.btn(type='submit', name='decision', value='deny') Deny
